      "value": "@{5cafb371ac3c2b014948f09c|full_name}: This is why I have started to provide videos instead. \nThe invite from BobyStar was unresponsive and could not be removed. On top you'll also see an invite from myself sent from the website that doesn't show up in my notifications. If I sent a second invite to myself it will show up under the dead one.\nSo it's not really about missing the controls for the card.",
